<parameter name="content"># Crisis Compass

A centralized directory of local, verified services for housing, substance use, and mental health support.

## Quick Start

Open `index.html` in a browser, or serve locally:

```bash
python3 -m http.server 8000
```

Then open http://localhost:8000

## Features

- Search by city, ZIP, or service type
- Filter by state (all 50 US states)
- Client type and accessibility filters
- Geolocation-based search
- Interactive map view
- Multi-language support (English, Spanish, French, Arabic)
- Quick exit for safety
- Low-data mode

## Data

Services are stored in `resources.json`. Replace with your verified local dataset.

## Deployment

This project is configured for GitHub Pages. Push to the `main` branch and it will be available at:

https://aakash-srinivasan02.github.io/Crisis_Compass/
